window.products.push({"id":103100,"name":"4392065 Dryer Maintenance Repair Kit by Beaquicy - Replacement for Whirlpool Ken-More Crosley Admiral Amana Dryer - Package Includes Drum Roller Belt ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mOwupeqcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【4392065 Dryer Repair Kit】:4392065 Dryer Repair Kit for 29\" wide dryers with the lint filter located on the top of the dryer.▶691366 Idler Pulley sits between the motor and drum to keep tension on the drive belt. It allows the belt to turn so that the dryer’s drum spins and helps dry your clothes.▶341241 Dryer Drum Belt attaches to the drum, idler pulley, and motor pulley. As the armature of the motor rotates, the belt begins to move and turns the drum. This belt features 4 ribs and 3 grooves. ✅【VALUE PACKAGING】:4392065 Whirlpool drum roller kit Includes 1 x 691366 idler pulley, 1 x 341241 dryer drum belt( 92 1/4 inches in length, and 1/4 inch wide), 1 x 349241T dryer rear drum support roller kit( includes 2 x drum rollers, 4 x tri-rings, 2 x retaining washers). The 4392065 Dryer Repair Kit is made of strong plastic, rubber and stainless that prevent cracking and failure during installation and use, smooth surface, non-toxic and durable,not easy to break. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】:The 4392065 Maintenance Dryer Repair Kit supports 365 DAYS RETURN and EXCHANGE. 349241T Dryer Rear Drum Support Roller Kit support the dryer drum as it spins. It is recommended to replace both rollers at once. And it's worth noting that the roller bearings are self-lubricating, there is no need to lubricate them yourself.▶4392065 amana dryer roller kit replaces EAP373087, AP3131942, 587636, PS373087, 279436, 279708, 279435, 279709, 279860, 2014, 8106, 8237, 26000279435, etc. ✅【FITS MOST 29\" WIDE DRYER】:Dryer Repair Kit 4392065 Replacement fits most 29\" wide Kenmore, Whirlpool, Estate, Roper, Kitchen-Aid, and other brand dryers.☞ Compatible model numbers includes WED4890XQ0, WED4890XQ1, WED4890XQ2, WED5590SQ0, 7MMEDC300DW0, 7MMEP0080WW1, 7MMGD6630TM1, 7MNGH8000TT0, 7MRGX4634MQ0, 7MRGX4634MQ1, KEYS850LT0, KGYS700JT2, KGYS700LQ0, IP80000, IP80001, CED123SEW0, CED126SBW1, CED126SXQ0, TGDS740JQ2, TGDS740PQ0, TGDS740PQ1, TGDS840JQ1, 11065212610, 11065232610, etc. ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】:To accomplish this 4392065 whirlpool roller replacement kit is simple. Before replacing the part, disconnect the power source from your dryer before beginning any repair. You can follow the video on the YouTube and complete the installation.▶ 4392065 Dryer maintenance kit can FIXES THE FOLLOWING SYMPATOMS: ①Stop turning,②The drum rotates, ③there is a lot of noise in the dryer, ④Will not tumble, ⑤Will not start, ⑥No heat or not enough heat, ⑦Dryer takes too long to dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mOwupeqcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B084ZJGDM9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-103100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084ZJGDM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B084ZJGDM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
