window.products.push({"id":103164,"name":"(2 pack) Reusable Organic Washable Eco friendly 100% Cotton Coffee Filter For Coffee Machine and Pour Over Coffee (2 pack, No4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BLBGe-KgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MORE THAN 2 YEARS: Provides long-term use unlike disposable paper filters. Thus, while reducing the amount of waste, it also contributes to your budget. Also, you can get rid of the paper smell that occurs in paper filters. GOTS-CERTIFIED (GLOBAL ORGANİC TEXTİLE STANDARD: It is a product that supports sustainability and is sewn from a GOTS-certified (GLOBAL ORGANIC TEXTILE STANDARD) 100% COTTON fabric produced in Turkey. Natural and unbleached cotton makes your coffee taste better than other filters. Also, the more you use the filter, the better the coffee flavor you will get. EASY CLEANING: Wash with water before first use. Empty any remaining coffee after use and rinse thoroughly with water. Wait for it to dry. You can use it again after it is completely dry. It can be cleaned by keeping it in warm water with \"NATURAL CLEANERS\" periodically. The color change is observed due to use and this is a natural consequence of the filter being reusable and this is normal. REAL COFFEE FLAVOR-100% COTTON: As you use it, the pores of the fabric become more frequent and you can taste a more delicious coffee flavor. If you wash it at a very high temperature, it can shrink in size as it is 100% cotton. It was sewn by calculating the shrinkage rate of the fabric after use. AESTHETIC DESIGN: It is prepared in accordance with the STANDARD NUMBER 4 coffee filters. Thanks to the strip label, you can easily hang it on a hanger to dry. In addition, it is now more stylish with its renewed aesthetic design. This pack includes 2 reusable #no.4 reusable cotton coffee filters. Not suitable for Chemex.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BLBGe-KgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yofu yoga and food","source_asin":"B0BFFP9VQN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-103164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFFP9VQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFFP9VQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":103165,"name":"WATOOR 120 Cans Wine Cooler and Beverage Refrigerator - Mini Fridge with Glass Reversible Door for Soda Beer or Wine 3.2 Cu Ft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FuWuCAy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3.2 Cu. Ft. Capacity】- At 3.2 Cubic Feet, the Watoor Beverage Refrigerator is compact enough for the modern home however spacious enough to store a sizable amount of drinks. Each wine cooler measures 17.52 x 18.7 x 31.5 inches and is light and easy to move. It allows you to hold up to 36 red or white wine bottles or 100 12-oz. Cans in this beverage refrigerator. Perfect for your game room. 【Easy Temperature Adjustment】- Easily change the temperature by using the adjustable thermostat located on front of the fridge. Choose a number between 1 (Off) to 7 (Coldest). Temperatures range from 32°F and 61°F which allows you to customize temp for your favorite foods. Equipped with  Blue L E D Lights, Movable Black Shelves, Glass Door and Adjustable Leveling Legs. 【Double Glass Door】 - Double Pane Glass Door can block out harmful UV rays and help to maintain an ideal humidity level. The tight door seal ensures maximum insulation. Reversible door hinge allows for complete flexibility in design. With reversible door, you can open the door from right or left. 【Perfectly Quiet】 - The Watoor wine cooler combines a modern design with a whisper quiet compressor which means you can say goodbye to low level hums and enjoy the sound of silence. Feel more relaxed in your own home with reduced noise distractions. 【With a Fan Inside】- There is a fan inside to keep internal temperature balanced. Every Watoor beverage cooler includes Removable Shelves . Sturdy, Removable, adjustable racks let you keep almost any size can or bottle in this beverage cooler. Product approved by ETL.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FuWuCAy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATOOR","source_asin":"B0B5DBQ76D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-103165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5DBQ76D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5DBQ76D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
