window.products.push({"id":103392,"name":"Cotton Coffee Filter for Pour-Over Cones #4 Reusable Coffee Filters (3-Pack) Handmade by Hide & Drink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xqfDnP48L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"CLASSIC AND ATTRACTIVE HANDMADE DESIGN: The Cotton Coffee Filter combines practicality and functionality with a classic and attractive design. Handcrafted, hand sewn and fits into your filter coffee machine, this is a must for all coffee lovers wanting to experience the perfect cup of joe. Initially, boil new filters in fresh water to clean and shrink for 10 minutes for optimal functionality. HANDMADE FROM NATURAL MANTA COTTON: The Manta Cotton we use is a favorite over generations in Guatemala, one of the best coffee producers in the world, and we have certainly learned from the best. Traditionally used to make men’s shirts known \"Guayaberas\", this natural cotton fiber is strong and more loosely woven. It is known locally as “wild cotton” and is absolutely natural, unbleached, organic cotton. SAVE MONEY AND THE ENVIRONMENT: Disposable filters can be expensive and mostly end up in land fill sites. The washable and reusable Coffee Filter will serve you time after time. With this coffee filter you’ll be getting more bang for your buck as well as caffeine in your system! A VARIETY OF SIZES FOR ALL COFFEE MACHINES: Whatever brand, size and model of your coffee machine, there is a Hide & Drink Cotton Coffee Filter for you. We understand at Hide & Drink how important a good cup of coffee is for your well-being and to kick-start the day, so get the right sized filter for you and enjoy the benefits of a fantastic cup of coffee. SIMPLE AND FUNCTIONAL DESIGN, MAKES A GREAT GIFT: This makes an excellent gift for a friend, loved one or family member. We all know the coffee obsessives out there and this can be a sure fire winner for a birthday or special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xqfDnP48L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hide & Drink","source_asin":"B01I02G328","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-103392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I02G328","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I02G328","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
